uality you can expect from the Early Access Release, but it represents a smaller part of the content. If you like it, it will be a great help to add the game to your wishlist.We are really happy to read your feedbacks from t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T03:29:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067939881","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4660470-1839041357032298","game_id":"steam-4660470","kind":"update","title":"Demo Summer Update","summary":"We're happy to update the Near Mint demo to show what we've been working on for the last few months.Great progress has been made on a third biome, with dangerous foes and a terrifying boss, and new cards for other heroes. These will be part of the game's release, so we won't take too much time on it here.Your feedback has been of great help — we gathered it on the official Discord, on the Steam forums, and through DMs and forms from playtesters. We're delighted that the demo has been so well rec","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-25T16:33:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357032298","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4660470-1831432155578307","game_id":"steam-4660470","kind":"announcement","title":"Near Mint demo is out!","summary":"We revealed the game a week ago, and released a demo soon after. All the team is really happy about the game reception, and we are hyped to work on new content for the full release.This week, Steam is organizing the Deckbuilders festival, and we are part of it. I hope you will celebrate with us by playing the demo and sharing your thoughts.Torn Cards & Forsaken HeroesNear Mint is a roguelike deckbuilder where you create your own cards and combine them in a unique and everchanging deck.The demo h","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-04T18:13:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155578307","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4660470":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:17:24Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:17:23Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4660470":"2026-10-26T13:17:24Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4660470":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:17:23Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:17:23Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:17:23Z"},"4662480":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:17:24Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:17:24Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:17:24Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4660470","app_id":4660470,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:46Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"78e5a63d88c0aab9f6e4bb7bd0b0b61f13a939a6435051cb1a705b7541eb513a","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"나만의 카드를 만들고, 독창적이며 끊임없이 변화하는 덱으로 조합하십시오. 적대적인 땅을 탐험하며 싸우고, 기이한 생물들을 만나고, 이 로그라이크 덱빌더에서 완벽한 전략을 완성하십시오.","publishers":[{"name":"Duper Games","creator_clan_account_id":45672325},{"name":"Black Soup"}],"developers":[{"name":"Duper Games","creator_clan_account_id":45672325}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1794409200,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full","is_early_access":true},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Near Mint Trailer","trailer_url_form